{
  "rules": [
    {
      "title": "{{PROJECT}}: payment provider failing",
      "condition": "C",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 900,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "{{DATASOURCE}}",
          "model": {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "sum(count_over_time({app=\"{{APP}}\"} | json | event=\"paymongo.request_failed\" [15m]))",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "queryType": "range",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 900,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "expression": "A",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "reducer": "last",
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 900,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "type": "gt",
                  "params": [
                    2
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "expression": "B",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "threshold"
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "1m",
      "keep_firing_for": "0s",
      "annotations": {
        "description": "More than 2 refused calls to PayMongo in 15 minutes: minting an intent, attaching a method, reading a status or a customer. `path`, `status` and the provider's `body` are on the line, and only the last 500 characters of it. 400 `payment_method_not_allowed` is a mode mismatch rather than an outage: live refuses the e-wallets and only QR Ph is attachable.",
        "summary": "{{PROJECT}}: payment provider failing"
      },
      "labels": {
        "severity": "warning"
      },
      "isPaused": false
    },
    {
      "title": "{{PROJECT}}: payment webhook rejected",
      "condition": "C",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 900,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "{{DATASOURCE}}",
          "model": {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "sum(count_over_time({app=\"{{APP}}\"} | json | event=~\"paymongo[.]webhook_signature[.][a-z]+\" [15m]))",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "queryType": "range",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 900,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "expression": "A",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "reducer": "last",
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 900,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "type": "gt",
                  "params": [
                    0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "expression": "B",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "threshold"
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "1m",
      "keep_firing_for": "0s",
      "annotations": {
        "description": "More than 2 deliveries refused by `verify_signature` in 15 minutes. The event on the line names the reason: `malformed` is a header missing its timestamp or signature slot, `mismatch` is the wrong secret or a forger (`livemode_slot` says which slot the provider did send), `stale` is a real event outside the 300s tolerance, which is a genuine delivery dropped. Premium is only ever written from a delivery that verifies, so this is money arriving with nothing credited behind it.",
        "summary": "{{PROJECT}}: payment webhook rejected"
      },
      "labels": {
        "severity": "critical"
      },
      "isPaused": false
    },
    {
      "title": "{{PROJECT}}: money unattributable",
      "condition": "C",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 1800,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "{{DATASOURCE}}",
          "model": {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "sum(count_over_time({app=\"{{APP}}\"} | json | event=~\"paymongo[.]webhook[.](payment_without_intent|unattributable_refund)\" [30m]))",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "queryType": "range",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 1800,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "expression": "A",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "reducer": "last",
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 1800,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "type": "gt",
                  "params": [
                    0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "expression": "B",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "threshold"
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "0s",
      "keep_firing_for": "0s",
      "annotations": {
        "description": "Money that reached no owner: a paid event carrying no intent id at all, or a settled refund whose ids chain back to no row (`payment_id`, `refund_id` and `payment_intent_id` are on the line). Either premium is still serving on money that came back, or a payment bought nothing. Never normal, so it fires on the first one: reconcile it by hand, the handler refuses to guess an owner (MONETIZATION \u00a75).",
        "summary": "{{PROJECT}}: money unattributable"
      },
      "labels": {
        "severity": "critical"
      },
      "isPaused": false
    },
    {
      "title": "{{PROJECT}}: money back",
      "condition": "C",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 3600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "{{DATASOURCE}}",
          "model": {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "sum(count_over_time({app=\"{{APP}}\"} | json | event=\"paymongo.webhook.revoke\" [1h]))",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "queryType": "range",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 3600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "expression": "A",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "reducer": "last",
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 3600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "type": "gt",
                  "params": [
                    0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "expression": "B",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "threshold"
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "0s",
      "keep_firing_for": "0s",
      "annotations": {
        "description": "A refund or a chargeback ended a paid period now, by design (MONETIZATION \u00a75): `status` on the line is `refunded` or `disputed`, and `event_type` says which delivery carried it. `revoked: false` means the event found no premium row to take, so nothing changed. Only a provider delivery reaches this rule: a hand revocation (`revoke.sh`) writes the row itself and is silent here.",
        "summary": "{{PROJECT}}: money back"
      },
      "labels": {
        "severity": "warning"
      },
      "isPaused": false
    }
  ]
}
